WEBVTT

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.650
Huh?

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.420
What's going on?

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:07.990
Hey!

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.010
That's dangerous!

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:09.570
Hey!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.290
A monkey?

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.200
Or a giant flying squirrel.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:11.820
Hey!!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.990
No, it's just a cute girl.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.530
Just what you were hoping for...

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:15.570
Hey!

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:16.040
Huh?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:16.920
It's actually a person.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:17.660
A child.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:18.460
Be careful!

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.370
What are you doing?!

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.200
That's too high!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.460
Come down!

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.720
Hey!

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.380
Hey, what are you doing?

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.440
I've lost something.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.340
And I can't seem to find it.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.050
It's dangerous up there.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.100
It feels great up here.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.760
Why don't you come up here as well.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.170
Eh?

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.480
C-Capisce!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.390
Rock, Paper, Scissors!

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:45.580
Look that way!

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:48.800
Now!

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.120
You won this time, Rina-chan.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.560
T-That sound...

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.290
Glo!

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.200
It's a call from him!

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.090
H-Hello.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.090
It's been a while, Miss Gloria.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:16.300
I-It has been a while.

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.850
We have found the ultimate princess candidate.

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.370
Huh? The ultimate princess?

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:24.810
W-What do you mean?

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.870
The one who will win the GrandPrix,

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.690
and get to ride atop the lead float in the Dream Parade...

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:32.030
...is PriPara's ultimate princess.

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:35.740
I believe she should be arriving there shortly.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:38.950
I'll be leaving her in your care.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:43.890
Why have you come to Parajuku?

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.120
Prince-sama invited me.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.830
P-Prince-sama?

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.910
Yes, he's a truly wonderful person.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:54.820
I can't see forests or lakes here,

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:57.600
but I've always dreamed of living a city life.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.800
I'll do my best!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.350
I-I see.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:05.980
Yahoo!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.600
The Girl From the Palps: Fuwari.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.030
A princess candidate is coming here!

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:52.490
What should I do? What should I do?

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.460
Anyway, I should head out to greet her.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.300
Good afternoon.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.390
Yes, good aftern-

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.380
Hold it right there!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.630
Yes?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.650
What's with the goat?!

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.870
We became friends on the way here.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.780
Take off your hat when you're inside!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.060
Ah, pardon me.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.770
Seriously, why a goat?!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:17.190
This is an introduction letter from Prince-sama.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:20.650
You're the ultimate princess candidate?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.000
Yes.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.290
I'm Midorikaze Fuwari.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.870
Nice to meet you.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.830
You're...

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:34.790
...PriPara's ultimate princess that shall get to ride atop the lead float in the Dream Parade?!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:42.670
<i>She's... She's this girl that smells like goat mixed with grass, acorns, mushrooms, and deer droppings?!</i>

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.980
<i>I do remember him saying something about this...</i>

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:48.260
<i>I'm sure there must be a reason.</i>

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.010
Understood.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:53.400
This mountain smell that clings to you, I, Ookanda Gloria, and...

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.370
...Rina-chan...

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:58.230
...will cleanse you of it.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:06.230
Here at Paprika Academy, you shall receive training that will take you from zero to being the ultimate princess.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.380
Right.
Stop!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.350
I'll do my best.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.160
Spit it out!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.410
Big news!

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:18.180
The PriPara princess scholarship student is transferring in today!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.880
Princess scholarship student?

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.770
It's the talk of the school!

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.650
I wonder what she's like.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.300
I'm interested.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.470
Her name's Midorikaze Fuwari.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.940
She's from the Palps mountainous area in Europe.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.850
Of course Prez would know.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.970
She's a second year in middle school,

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:40.060
but she's given special permission to live in the Paprika Academy High School dorms.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.130
Eh?!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.460
Unprecedented!

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.070
Wait, we have a high school?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.920
And dorms?

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.990
We do.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.390
They've been around for quite some time.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:52.860
They're behind the gymnasium.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:54.950
Eh? That's news to us!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.160
How careless.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.170
I couldn't read it.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.750
But living in the dorms sounds fun.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.450
By the way, the principal is the head mistress.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:07.930
On second thought, never mind.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.980
Princess scholarship student, huh?

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:17.000
She'll be the centre of attention in the
upcoming Summer Dream Idol GrandPrix.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.150
Will she be a rival? Or a partner?

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:24.860
We don't know yet, but let us focus on PriPara.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.110
Right!

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.330
Same goes for us!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.940
Let's search for our next teammates!

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.570
...is what I'd like to say,

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:36.380
but I also have work I need to do as the student council president.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.710
I have to go meet the princess scholarship student now.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.130
Eh?!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.410
Wow, we really do have a high school.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.320
You don't have to come with me.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:49.780
But I want to meet her.

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:52.050
It would be rude if I didn't meet her fully dressed up.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.350
As the Princess scholarship student, I'm sure she'll look like this.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.770
She's so sparkly!

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:01.690
Midorikaze-san!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.860
Why are you sleeping there?

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:13.320
Good morning, Miss Gloria.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.940
That bed is far too soft.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:20.440
In Palps we always sleep on straw.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.570
You mustn't!

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.790
You need to behave like a princess!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.490
It's hard to move around in those pyjamas.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.000
Ah! It's you!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.400
Oh, you're from yesterday.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.510
Huh? You know her?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.970
Yeah, sort of.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.730
It's nice to properly meet you.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.350
I'm Manaka Lala.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.940
I'm the Student Council President and the Public Morals President, Minami Mirelle.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.560
I'm Houjou Sophie.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.900
I'm a reincarnation of a jellyfish.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.480
I'm Fuwari.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:52.030
I'm aiming to be PriPara's ultimate princess.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.410
How much longer do you plan on being in your pyjamas?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.310
Hurry up and change into your school uniform.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.830
I'll be good in this.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.250
This is easier to move in.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.210
Ah! H-H-H-Hold it!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:19.580
Miss Gloria, may I take this off?

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:24.450
In Palps, even cows and goats wouldn't wear a collar like this.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.980
That's a neck tie.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.220
Please! It's suffocating!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:28.840
My turn.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:29.790
Huh?

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:32.860
Paprika Academy rule number 754:

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.650
"Students must address their teachers with respect"!

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.830
I'm sorry to do this right after changing schools,
but I'm issuing your first insubordination ticket!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:42.850
Now that I get a better look at you,
you look just like one of my friends!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.420
Eh? Friend?

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:50.850
Just like Komugi-chan's tail and her cute behind!

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:52.630
Gaa!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.580
Rule number 43:

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.400
"Don't say that someone looks like a horse's butt"!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.770
Waa!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.220
All right, let's go.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:07.730
Hey!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.700
School's going to be fun!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.060
Hey! Stop right there!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.220
Fuwari-chan seems to be really fun.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:14.540
Yeah, a goat's friend is a friend of mine.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.910
Fuwari, get back here and accept your second ticket!

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:21.710
I can understand her earlier feelings.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:24.460
But with my unrelenting guidance,

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.890
she'll surely become the ultimate princess.

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.240
Right, Rina-chwan?

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:34.550
Let's see, Midorikaze-san will sit...

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:38.510
Ah, there's no one sitting next to Dorthy West-san.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.850
<i>So this is the princess candidate.</i>

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:47.980
<i>Oh well, if I get along with her,
maybe she'll join our five person team.</i>

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.050
Nice to meet you.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:49.980
Yeah.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.330
If you're a princess, then I'm a queen,

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.910
so you can call me Your Highness.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.920
<i>She's got a tablet?!</i>

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.910
<i>How cheeky for a middle school student!</i>

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:02.760
What is it?

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:05.980
Wait. Is that a mini chalkboard?

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.960
It's because the goat will eat my paper...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.280
Baa.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.420
<i>"Baa"?</i>

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.260
That's my notebook!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.730
She said it's delicious.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.840
Man!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.040
She's the super worst!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.310
It's only been one day, but it's already been max craziness!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.640
Don't eat my test too!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.810
She said it's delicious.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.520
What are you fishing in the pool for?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.770
I caught it!

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.990
And when I wanted to eat my lunch...

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.600
What the heck are you doing?

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:38.960
Milking.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.580
Happy birthday, baby birdy!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.120
Don't go and hatch birds on my head!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.330
It was infuriating!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.600
Just what about her is princess-like?!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.320
Calm down, Dorthy.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.840
Relax. Relax.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:58.140
Well, I can sympathise with Dorthy's feelings.

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.650
With one wrong step, freedom becomes selfishness.

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:01.950
Just like Go!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.800
More like ego!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:08.000
Just because she might win, she thinks she can get away with anything!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:08.770
Yes, yes.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:13.640
With the way things are going, I wonder if
Fuwari-chan will get used to school and PriPara...

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:15.230
You're worried, huh?

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.610
I was just talking about  you, Fuwari-chan!

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.650
Huh?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.860
Oh, Lala!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.910
What are you looking for this time?

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.810
PriPara.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.120
I made a promise with Prince-sama.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:36.090
<i>PriPara is a wonderful place overflowing with dreams, aspirations, and other beautiful things.</i>

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:41.550
<i>Will you become the ultimate princess at PriPara for me?</i>

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.090
<i> Eh?</i>

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.490
<i>Yes, I'd be glad to.</i>

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.110
I wonder what kind of place PriPara is.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.710
I can't wait to go!

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:53.260
Then let's go together.

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:53.930
Eh?

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.120
Hello, Mega-neesan.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.710
Ah, you have a new face with you.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:03.320
Did you bring your PriTicket with you?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.280
Ah, this, right?

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.790
I heard about it from Prince-sama.

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:10.650
Then let's choose your coord.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:12.440
What's a coord?

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:15.050
She's searching for the brand that best fits you.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:17.500
I wonder what kind of coord would look best on you.

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.400
The perfect brand for you is...

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.680
T-There isn't one.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.130
Huh?

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:27.970
Eh?

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:28.590
Huh?

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.390
What?!

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:43.070
What do you mean there isn't a brand?

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:47.290
For some reason I can't find a coord that would fit her perfectly.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:50.540
This is the first time something like this has happened.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.010
No way...

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:55.540
I'll make a new brand that suits you on the double.

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:59.040
In the meantime, how about...

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:07.210
Please deal with these clothes for today.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.140
I'm Lala.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.360
Eh?!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.370
Since her brand registration has not been completed,

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:19.150
she can't enter any concerts.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.490
Eh? Isn't there anything you can do?

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:22.940
That's how the system works.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:33.000
Man, I wanted to do a concert with Fuwari-chan in cute coords.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.830
I'm sorry, Fuwari-chan.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.830
This is...

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:41.230
This is PriPara!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.770
It's just like Prince-sama described!

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:48.050
PriPara is a wonderful place.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.790
I'm glad you think it's so great.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:51.690
Oh!

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:55.060
There are more places I'd like to show you over there.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.650
Come on! Over here!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.460
Wow!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.970
There's so much greenery and flowers!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.990
The air smells just like it does in Palps.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:09.840
Kuma?!

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:14.870
Here I was drinking vegetable juice in a place like this, and then you had to go and do that-kuma!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.340
My precious vegetable juice...

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:20.210
I spilled 350ml of it-kuma!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.800
I-I'm sorry.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.740
Don't think you can just get of with an "I'm sorry"!

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.900
Hand over enough to fill a bathtub to show you're sorry-kuma!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.340
You rooster...

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.180
Kuma?

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:33.720
Ku...

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.970
Kuma!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.980
What a refreshing smile.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:41.400
More like I've been healed by a soft breeze across the plains-kuma.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:45.400
I'm surprised that such a cute girl such as yourself is here in PriPara-kuma.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:49.010
It seems Kuma-san has also taken a liking to you, Fuwari-chan.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:49.710
Eh?

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.720
Is this a friend of yours, Lala?

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.750
Who is this girl-kuma?!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.620
What's her name?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:55.570
What year?

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:57.060
Blood type?

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.340
What's her type? Could it be a bear like me...?

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:02.200
Type? A bear might be too much...

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.790
Wah! Fuwari-chan?!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.090
Where are you?!

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:09.300
Attention idols,

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:14.810
we'll be switching the hologrammation to artificial rain to water the flowers and greenery.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.390
This was the system.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.100
Wa-

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.140
No way!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.350
I'm getting all wet!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.060
Let's wait in the café until it stops.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.270
Huh?

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.930
What are you doing out there-pri?

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.490
I got separated from Fuwari-chan.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.240
Over there.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.740
Huh?

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.510
What beautiful flowers.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.010
And the rain feels great.

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:58.890
Fuwari... chan?

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.770
Wait, my servant!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.430
Wow, such a big audience-nano!

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:36.020
One must fear those who hold the power to manipulate animals!

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:37.600
Mikan wants to be her friend-nano!

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:40.560
<i>This is the power of the princess candidate.</i>

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:44.720
<i>She has a charm that's different than any other girl-pri.</i>

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.820
<i>If we form a five person team with her,</i>

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.780
<i>I'm sure we'll be able to sweep the
Summer Dream Idol GrandPrix-pri!</i>

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.990
Wow!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:00.850
Hooray!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.410
Yeah!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.920
That was incredible, Fuwari-chan.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.870
Your voice is clearer than a jellyfish.

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.630
Even your impromptu concert is great-pri.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.800
Thanks,

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:12.840
but...

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.640
What's a concert?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:19.430
That's right. You've always lived in the mountains.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.690
You've never seen a concert before.

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:23.180
Would you show her?

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.140
Eh? Me?

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.400
Even if you say that...

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.610
I want to see Lala's concert.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:34.140
Just get out there and show her-pri.

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:35.570
Well...

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.680
Capisce!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:41.790
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:45.370
Coord Change Start!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:51.570
An image of a sparkling Hydrangea wet with rain.

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.000
The sheer frills are elegant!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.510
Hydrangea Bouquet Coord!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.790
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:15.680
Princess...

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.050
Princess, where are you-kuma?!!

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:20.580
Kuma?

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.930
Flower garden in full bloom!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.050
For you!

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:28.400
Lovely Flower Cinderella!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:30.060
Kuma!

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:33.970
Cyalume Change!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.500
<i>That was wonderful, Lala.</i>

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.970
<i>This is PriPara.</i>

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.710
<i>This is a concert.</i>

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:28.240
<i>I want to début as soon as I can.</i>

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:30.790
<i>And become the ultimate princess.</i>

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:35.750
Lala, that was really, really wonderful.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.570
Thanks.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:38.740
All right, let's snap.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:39.210
Okay.

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.220
How the heck did you snap cheese?!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.350
It's authentic Palps cheese.

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.310
This is how you exchange Friend Tickets.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.770
Let's do a concert together someday.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:55.090
Yeah.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.940
At this time the rain will stop.

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:00.960
This was the system.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.530
Prince-sama...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:15.460
I'll make sure to to become a princess worthy of you.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.380
Miss Gloria,

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.270
I will also be arriving shortly.

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:07.190
Prince-sama.

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:10.320
I'll make sure to become a beautiful princess.

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:12.740
I look forward to it, my princess.

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:15.910
Why has Fuwari-chan's Prince-sama come to Paprika Academy?

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:18.870
I want to sing at PriPara soon!

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:21.620
We'll help you search for a manager.

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:25.670
We'll make Fuwari our friend and be the next ones to do the GrandPrix.

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.420
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:28.820
Next time:

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:31.830
Prince-sama and the Blue Bird of Sadness.

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:33.170
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:34.680
Let's go PriPara!
